1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Man: I'm having trouble deciding which laptop to buy

2
00:00:04,080 --> 00:00:06,120
There are so many options out there.

3
00:00:06,120 --> 00:00:09,070
Woman: Have you narrowed it down at all?

4
00:00:09,070 --> 00:00:13,972
Man: Sort of. I'm debating between a high-performance model for gaming

5
00:00:13,972 --> 00:00:17,240
and a more budget-friendly one for everyday tasks.

6
00:00:17,240 --> 00:00:20,220
Woman: Have you read some user reviews

7
00:00:21,240 --> 00:00:25,030
They might help you decide if the extra cost would be worthwhile.

8
00:00:25,030 --> 00:00:31,697
Man: Yeah, maybe. Though the reviews of the sneakers I bought last month said they're super-durable,

9
00:00:31,697 --> 00:00:35,030
and yet I have holes in them already.
